# Code owners for sales.demos.
#
# Listing an owner here REQUESTS a review automatically when a matching path
# changes. It does NOT gate the merge: on `main` this repo has
# `require_code_owner_reviews` = false and `required_approving_review_count` = 0,
# both deliberate. See CLAUDE.md — the point is the branch-and-PR flow, not
# waiting on a second person's availability.
#
# A rule naming a user who cannot be resolved is SILENTLY INERT — check with
#   gh api repos/ericcames/sales.demos/codeowners/errors
# That check validates owners and syntax. It does NOT validate paths: a rule for
# a path that no longer exists is equally inert and still reports zero errors, so
# paths need a human. Measured 2026-09-10 against two dead rules.

